        "gg3RGcdsqN__text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">1. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>",
        "gg3iH55L4Vr_text": "<p>ReGrow™ isn't just about hair. It's about getting back the confidence you had before thinning started. Join thousands of men who've already transformed not just their hairline, but how they feel when they look in the mirror. Thicker hair. Stronger presence. <strong>Better version of yourself.</strong></p>",
        "gg7ajWu5HYP_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Pas d'étapes compliquées, pas de longues routines. Tamponnez-le délicatement sur les zones clairsemées (on dirait que vous tapotez avec votre ongle), et c'est terminé en moins de 60 secondes. Constatez des améliorations visibles en seulement une semaine, avec une croissance remarquable en 8 à 10 semaines.</span></p>",
        "gg9jYiee2Ux_text": "1. PASSEZ DE LA PERTE DE CHEVEUX À UNE CHEVELURE COMPLÈTE INSTANTANÉMENT",
        "ggAfEwZaHfX_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">2. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>",
        "ggBuXqnlX5v_text": "2. EFFORTLESS, PAINLESS, AND DONE IN 60 SECONDS",
        "ggDUaJgKbVe_text": "<strong>3. CLINICALLY VALIDATED &amp; DERMATOLOGIST APPROVED</strong>",
        "ggDgUGQ3BgZ_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\"><strong>We stand behind our results.</strong></span><br>Every ReGrow™ order comes with our complete satisfaction guarantee. If you don't see thicker, fuller hair taking shape within 90 days, we'll refund every penny. No hassle, no questions asked. You have nothing to lose except the hair you're already losing.</p>",
        "ggLxhXdAkRm_text": "<strong>5. CONFIDENCE STARTS WITH HEALTHY HAIR</strong>",
        "ggQcV0SPRl3_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">3. APPLICATION INDOLORE EN UNE MINUTE</span>",
        "ggUVMhu0dq0_text": "2. EFFORTLESS, PAINLESS, AND FAST",
        "ggYDJqukkP8_text": "<strong>4. 90-DAY MONEY-BACK PROMISE, ZERO RISK</strong>",
        "ggZb395-ucR_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">5. REJOIGNEZ LA LÉGION DES HOMMES CONFIANTS</span>",
        "gg_jSn-ii-R_text": "<span style=\"font-size:24px;\">4. GARANTIE DE CROISSANCE DE 120 JOURS - ZÉRO RISQUE</span>",
        "ggageb314dy_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:18px;\">Tired of trying endless products that promise results but never deliver? Discover how <strong>REGROW™</strong> revitalizes your scalp from the inside out, for visibly thicker, stronger hair in record time, without complicated treatments.</span></p>",
        "gggsNSdZ6Nf_text": "<strong>5. CONFIDENCE STARTS WITH HEALTHY HAIR</strong>",
        "ggigksYMOGT_text": "<p><strong>REGROW™</strong> works directly where hair loss begins, by reducing excess DHT and stimulating dormant follicles.</p><p><br>Our precision micro-needles create ultra-fine openings in the scalp, allowing the active serum to penetrate deeply, halt shedding in just one week, and trigger <strong>new growth within 8–10 weeks.</strong></p>",
        "ggjCATAKblz_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">No messy foams. No daily pills. No complicated multi-step routines. Simply press the micro-infusion applicator gently onto thinning areas (it feels like light pressure, similar to pressing your fingertip on your scalp), and you're finished in under a minute. The convenience means you'll actually stick with it, and consistency is what delivers results.</span></p>",
        "ggjkv5m1vuM_text": "<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;font-size:16px;\"><strong>ReGrow™ targets the #1 enemy of hair growth: DHT buildup that chokes your follicles. </strong>Our micro-infusion system creates microscopic pathways in your scalp, delivering active ingredients directly where they're needed most, blocking DHT at the source and reactivating dormant follicles. <strong>Most men notice less shedding within the first 7 to 10 days, with visible new growth appearing in 8 to 12 weeks.</strong></span></p>",
        "ggnvT7KBOpQ_text": "1. FROM THINNING HAIR TO VISIBLE DENSITY, FAST",
        "ggpiz-sEMZs_text": "1. PASSEZ DE LA PERTE DE CHEVEUX À UNE CHEVELURE COMPLÈTE INSTANTANÉMENT",
        "ggqeDBNjmZ7_text": "<strong>4. 90-DAY MONEY-BACK PROMISE</strong>",
        "ggtYc7Qs-ws_text": "<strong>3. CLINICALLY VALIDATED &amp; DERMATOLOGIST APPROVED</strong>",
        "ggvaUBZF1D__text": "<span style=\"font-size:22px;\">5 REASONS WHY REGROW™ STOPS HAIR LOSS AND REBUILDS DENSITY, WITHOUT THE GUESSWORK</span>",
        "ggw0EF81rp6_text": "1. FROM THINNING HAIR TO DENSITY — FAST",
        "ggx9SeSwdGe_text": "<p><span style=\"font-size:17px;\">Developed with leading hair restoration specialists and backed by clinical research, <strong>ReGrow™ combines proven botanical extracts</strong> like Saw Palmetto, Biotin, and Caffeine with our proprietary delivery system. This isn't guesswork. It's science-backed hair regrowth that dermatologists trust and recommend to their own patients.</span></p>"
